<code>assert this.size() > 0 => ((Comparable<E>) this.peek()).compareTo((Comparable<E>) \old(this.peek())) >= 0;</code>

This ensures that if the queue is not empty after the removal, the new head is greater than or equal to the old head according to the natural ordering or the provided comparator.

